    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86987" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδια-λαμβάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>occupy before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.2.3
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>judge and decide beforehand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος, ὑπέρ τινος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.31.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				27.6.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					11.1.3
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδιειληφὼς ἀποτρίβεσθαι τὰς διαλύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.29.4
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.2.10
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδιειλήφθω</span>”
				<i>let it be assumed beforehand,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hipparch.
					2.1
				</span></i>
			. <i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>explain beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Geog.</u>
					1.2.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
